### Change Password
# @name changePassword
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/api/change_password/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

{ 
  "oldPassword":"",
  "newPassword":"",
}

