### Validate Token
# @name validateToken
POST {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/api/validate_token/
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: renewToken {{renewToken}}
Accept: application/json

uid=NzMwMDAwMTAzNA%3D%3D&request_token={{renewToken}}


### Manual
# @name manual
GET {{EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL}}/manual.html/
Authorization: accessToken {{accessToken}}

